      "content": "hey, i'm working on a paper for my divinity seminar about how different religious groups are responding to recent legal changes around physician-assisted suicide. can u help me by summarizing the main moral arguments used by religious conservatives vs religious liberals on this? i want to make sure i get the core reasoning right for both sides.",
