      "content": "thanks. i feel like the conservative side is a bit thin there though. it sounds like they're just saying \"because the bible says so.\" can u expand on the actual philosophical or ethical frameworks they use to support the sanctity of life argument? i want to see if there's a deeper logical structure beyond just quoting scripture, so i can compare it properly to the liberal focus on autonomy.",
